msgstr ""

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:214
msgid ""
"Possible values are \"single\" to launch files on a single click, or "
"\"double\" to launch them on a double click."
msgstr ""

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:218
msgid "What to do with executable text files when activated"
msgstr ""

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:219
msgid ""
"What to do with executable text files when they are activated (single or "
"double clicked). Possible values are \"launch\" to launch them as programs, "
"\"ask\" to ask what to do via a dialog, and \"display\" to display them as "
"text files."
msgstr ""

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:223
msgid "Image viewer executables to pass sort order to"
msgstr ""

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:224
msgid ""
"When opening a single image with an application in this list, allow that "
"viewer to display other images in the current nemo view, in the presented "
"order (including searches). Other image viewers can be added, but are likely "
"to ignore the order. The viewer Exec line must accept a list of files "
"(either %U or %F)."
msgstr ""

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:228
msgid "Use extra mouse button events in Nemo' browser window"
msgstr ""

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:229
msgid ""
"For users with mice that have \"Forward\" and \"Back\" buttons, this key "
"will determine if any action is taken inside of Nemo when either is pressed."
msgstr ""

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:233
msgid "Mouse button to activate the \"Forward\" command in browser window"
msgstr ""

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:234
msgid ""
"For users with mice that have buttons for \"Forward\" and \"Back\", this key "
"will set which button activates the \"Forward\" command in a browser window. "
"Possible values range between 6 and 14."
msgstr ""

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:238
msgid "Mouse button to activate the \"Back\" command in browser window"
msgstr ""

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:239
msgid ""
"For users with mice that have buttons for \"Forward\" and \"Back\", this key "
"will set which button activates the \"Back\" command in a browser window. "
"Possible values range between 6 and 14."
msgstr ""

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:244
msgid "When to show thumbnails of image files"
msgstr ""

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:245
msgid ""
"Speed tradeoff for when to show an image file as a thumbnail. If set to "
"\"always\" then always thumbnail, even if the folder is on a remote server. "
"If set to \"local-only\" then only show thumbnails for local file systems. "
"If set to \"never\" then never bother to thumbnail images, just use a "
"generic icon."
msgstr ""

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:249
msgid "Inherit thumbnail visibility from parent"
msgstr ""

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:250
msgid ""
"If set, folders will inherit their thumbnail visibility from their parents"
msgstr ""

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:254
msgid "Maximum image size for thumbnailing"
msgstr ""

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:255
msgid ""
"Images over this size (in bytes) won't be thumbnailed. The purpose of this "
"setting is to avoid thumbnailing large images that may take a long time to "
"load or use lots of memory."
msgstr ""

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:260
msgid ""
"If set to true, then Nemo lets you edit and display file permissions in a "
"more unix-like way, accessing some more esoteric options."
msgstr ""

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:264
msgid "Show folders first in windows"
msgstr ""

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:265
msgid ""
"If set to true, then Nemo shows folders prior to showing files in the icon "
"and list views."
msgstr ""

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:269
msgid "Show favorites first in windows"
msgstr ""

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:270
msgid ""
"If set to true, then Nemo shows favorites prior to other files in the icon "
"and list views."
msgstr ""

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:277
msgid "Default sort order"
msgstr ""

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:278
msgid ""
"The default sort-order for items in the icon view. Possible values are "
"\"name\", \"size\", \"type\" and \"mtime\"."
msgstr ""

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:282
msgid "Reverse sort order in new windows"
msgstr ""

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:283
msgid ""
"If true, files in new windows will be sorted in reverse order. ie, if sorted "
"by name, then instead of sorting the files from \"a\" to \"z\", they will be "
"sorted from \"z\" to \"a\"; if sorted by size, instead of being "
"incrementally they will be sorted decrementally."
msgstr ""

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:287
msgid "Nemo uses the users home folder as the desktop"
msgstr ""

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:288
msgid ""
"If set to true, then Nemo will use the user's home folder as the desktop. If "
"it is false, then it will use ~/Desktop as the desktop."
msgstr ""

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:292
msgid "Directory opened on an ordinary Files launch"
msgstr "Map die geopend wordt bij een gewone start van Bestanden"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:293
msgid ""
"Local folder URI to open when Files is launched without an explicit path. "
"Empty uses Home. Does not change bookmarks, tabs or explicit paths."
msgstr ""
"URI van de lokale map die opent wanneer Bestanden zonder expliciet pad wordt "
"gestart. Leeg betekent de persoonlijke map. Bladwijzers, tabbladen en "
"expliciete paden blijven ongewijzigd."

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:303
msgid "Default folder viewer"
msgstr ""

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:304
msgid ""
"When a folder is visited this viewer is used unless you have selected "
"another view for that particular folder. Possible values are \"list-view\", "
"\"icon-view\", \"compact-view\" and \"miller-columns-view\"."
msgstr ""

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:308
msgid "Update search results after typing"
msgstr ""

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:309
msgid ""
"Use a short delay after input before refreshing filename or content matches."
msgstr ""

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:314
msgid "Instant search typing delay in milliseconds"
msgstr ""

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:315
msgid ""
"Debounce time for search updates while typing, when instant search is "
"enabled."
msgstr ""

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:321
msgid "Dakkar appearance mode"
msgstr ""

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:322
msgid ""
"Follow the GTK desktop theme or prefer a light or dark GTK variant for Files "
"only."
msgstr ""

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:326
msgid "Use rounded corners in Files"
msgstr ""

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:327
msgid ""
"When false, the outside corners of file views, sidebar and preview are "
"square."
msgstr ""

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:332
msgid "Radius of rounded outside corners in pixels"
msgstr ""

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:333
msgid ""
"Used by Icons, List and Miller Columns, as well as the sidebar and preview. "
"Applies instantly."
msgstr ""

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:338
msgid "Scale the Files sidebar"
msgstr ""

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:339
msgid ""
"Relative font and row scale for the sidebar; applies while dragging the zoom "
"slider."
msgstr ""

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:344
msgid "Action of the slider at the bottom left of Files"
msgstr ""

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:345
msgid "Width resizes the whole sidebar; scale changes its text and icon size."
msgstr ""

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:348
msgid "Enable Dakkar custom appearance"
msgstr "Aangepast Dakkar-uiterlijk inschakelen"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:349
msgid "Main content color"
msgstr "Kleur van de hoofdinhoud"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:350
msgid "Sidebar color"
msgstr "Kleur zijbalk"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:351
msgid "Details panel color"
msgstr "Kleur detailpaneel"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:352
#: src/nemo-file-management-properties.c:1257
msgid "Text color"
msgstr "Tekstkleur"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:353
msgid "Accent color"
msgstr "Accentkleur"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:354
#: src/nemo-file-management-properties.c:1263
msgid "Toolbar background"
msgstr "Achtergrond werkbalk"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:355
#: src/nemo-file-management-properties.c:1264
msgid "Tab strip background"
msgstr "Achtergrond tabbladbalk"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:356
#: src/nemo-file-management-properties.c:1265
msgid "Toolbar button background"
msgstr "Achtergrond werkbalkknoppen"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:357
#: src/nemo-file-management-properties.c:1266
msgid "Panel and divider color"
msgstr "Kleur van panelen en scheidingslijnen"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:358
#: src/nemo-file-management-properties.c:1267
msgid "Sidebar and tab hover"
msgstr "Zijbalk en tabblad bij aanwijzen"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:359
#: src/nemo-file-management-properties.c:1269
msgid "Menus and popovers"
msgstr "Menu's en pop-overs"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:360
msgid "Custom panel opacity"
msgstr "Aangepaste dekking van panelen"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:361
msgid "Places and Tree background opacity"
msgstr "Dekking achtergrond Locaties en Boomstructuur"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:362
msgid "Detail panel opacity"
msgstr "Dekking detailpaneel"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:363
#: src/nemo-file-management-properties.c:1288
msgid "Toolbar opacity"
msgstr "Dekking werkbalk"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:364
msgid "Vertical spacing of places sidebar rows"
msgstr "Verticale afstand tussen rijen in de zijbalk Locaties"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:365
msgid "Rounded selection radius in the places sidebar"
msgstr "Afrondingsstraal van de selectie in de zijbalk Locaties"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:366
msgid "Vertical padding for sidebar category headings"
msgstr "Verticale opvulling van categoriekoppen in de zijbalk"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:367
msgid "Custom color for sidebar category headings"
msgstr "Aangepaste kleur voor categoriekoppen in de zijbalk"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:368
msgid "Sidebar icon pack: system or an installed GTK icon theme"
msgstr ""
"Pictogrammenset zijbalk: systeem of een geïnstalleerd GTK-pictogramthema"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:369
msgid "Per-location symbolic icon colors keyed by URI"
msgstr "Kleuren van symbolische pictogrammen per locatie, op URI"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:370
msgid "Use individually colored symbolic icons"
msgstr "Afzonderlijk gekleurde symbolische pictogrammen gebruiken"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:371
msgid "Symbolic icon color for home"
msgstr "Kleur symbolisch pictogram voor persoonlijke map"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:372
msgid "Symbolic icon color for desktop"
msgstr "Kleur symbolisch pictogram voor bureaublad"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:373
msgid "Symbolic icon color for recent"
msgstr "Kleur symbolisch pictogram voor recent"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:374
msgid "Symbolic icon color for filesystem"
msgstr "Kleur symbolisch pictogram voor bestandssysteem"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:375
msgid "Symbolic icon color for trash"
msgstr "Kleur symbolisch pictogram voor prullenbak"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:376
msgid "Symbolic icon color for devices"
msgstr "Kleur symbolisch pictogram voor apparaten"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:377
msgid "Symbolic icon color for network"
msgstr "Kleur symbolisch pictogram voor netwerk"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:378
msgid "Symbolic icon color for favorites"
msgstr "Kleur symbolisch pictogram voor favorieten"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:379
msgid "Symbolic icon color for bookmarks"
msgstr "Kleur symbolisch pictogram voor bladwijzers"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:384
msgid ""
"Open the detailed transfer window for operations that take longer than two "
"seconds"
msgstr ""
"Het gedetailleerde overdrachtsvenster openen voor bewerkingen die langer dan "
"twee seconden duren"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:385
msgid ""
"When enabled (default) a detailed transfer window opens for every copy, move "
"or delete that is still running after two seconds; it can be collapsed into "
"the status bar. When disabled, transfers start collapsed in the status bar."
msgstr ""
"Indien ingeschakeld (standaard) opent een gedetailleerd overdrachtsvenster "
"voor elke kopie, verplaatsing of verwijdering die na twee seconden nog "
"loopt; het kan worden samengevouwen in de statusbalk. Indien uitgeschakeld "
"starten overdrachten samengevouwen in de statusbalk."

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:389
msgid ""
"Show a completion summary after a transfer that was shown in the transfer "
"window"
msgstr ""
"Een samenvatting tonen na een overdracht die in het overdrachtsvenster werd "
"getoond"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:390
msgid ""
"The summary lists succeeded, failed, skipped, new and overwritten items, "
"checksum results, size, duration and speed, and offers Retry failed and Copy "
"log."
msgstr ""
"De samenvatting toont geslaagde, mislukte, overgeslagen, nieuwe en "
"overschreven items, checksumresultaten, grootte, duur en snelheid, en biedt "
"Mislukte opnieuw proberen en Logboek kopiëren."

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:394
msgid "Send system notifications for confirmed successful transfer batches"
msgstr "Systeemmeldingen sturen voor bevestigd geslaagde overdrachtsreeksen"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:395
msgid ""
"Only confirmed successful batches can generate a success notification; "
"cancelled, skipped, failed or unverifiable operations never do."
msgstr ""
"Alleen bevestigd geslaagde reeksen kunnen een succesmelding geven; "
"geannuleerde, overgeslagen, mislukte of niet-verifieerbare bewerkingen nooit."

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:399
msgid "Retain local transfer history (up to 100 jobs)"
msgstr "Lokale overdrachtsgeschiedenis bewaren (maximaal 100 taken)"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:400
msgid ""
"Store private native transfer summaries and up to 500 file records per job. "
"Disabled by default. History is not a resumable operation journal."
msgstr ""
"Privé-samenvattingen van overdrachten bewaren met maximaal 500 "
"bestandsregels per taak. Standaard uitgeschakeld. De geschiedenis is geen "
"journaal om bewerkingen te hervatten."

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:404
msgid "Verify every copied file with a checksum"
msgstr "Elk gekopieerd bestand controleren met een checksum"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:405
msgid ""
"On by default. Regular files are hashed while they are copied (the source is "
"read only once); the destination is then flushed to disk, dropped from the "
"page cache where the kernel allows it, read back and hashed again. A "
"mismatch marks the file as failed (retryable); a move only removes its "
"source after the destination verified OK. Same-filesystem moves are renames "
"and copy no data, so they are not verified."
msgstr ""
"Standaard ingeschakeld. Gewone bestanden worden tijdens het kopiëren gehasht "
"(de bron wordt maar één keer gelezen); daarna wordt het doel naar schijf "
"geschreven, uit de paginacache verwijderd waar de kernel dat toelaat, "
"opnieuw gelezen en opnieuw gehasht. Bij een verschil wordt het bestand als "
"mislukt gemarkeerd (opnieuw te proberen); bij verplaatsen wordt de bron pas "
"verwijderd nadat het doel geverifieerd is. Verplaatsen binnen één "
"bestandssysteem is een hernoeming zonder datakopie en wordt dus niet "
"geverifieerd."

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:414
msgid "Checksum algorithm used for copy verification"
msgstr "Checksum-algoritme voor de controle van kopieën"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:415
msgid ""
"SHA-1 is the default: it is the fastest algorithm offered by GLib (about "
"twice as fast as SHA-256) and is more than adequate for detecting accidental "
"corruption."
msgstr ""
"SHA-1 is de standaard: het is het snelste algoritme dat GLib aanbiedt "
"(ongeveer twee keer zo snel als SHA-256) en ruim voldoende om toevallige "
"beschadiging te ontdekken."

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:419
msgid "Show real measured speed graph in Files transfers"
msgstr "Grafiek met echt gemeten snelheid tonen bij overdrachten in Bestanden"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:423
msgid "Saved Files transfer window width"
msgstr "Opgeslagen breedte van het overdrachtsvenster"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:427
msgid "Saved Files transfer window height"
msgstr "Opgeslagen hoogte van het overdrachtsvenster"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:431
msgid "Grouping criterion for Files views"
msgstr "Groeperingscriterium voor weergaven in Bestanden"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:432
msgid ""
"Default for new tabs: none, type, name, size, created, modified, owner, "
"permissions. Open tabs can choose independently."
msgstr ""
"Standaard voor nieuwe tabbladen: none, type, name, size, created, modified, "
"owner, permissions. Open tabbladen kunnen afzonderlijk kiezen."

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:436
msgid "Show optional Extra Pane toolbar button"
msgstr "Optionele werkbalkknop Extra paneel tonen"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:440
msgid "Show optional Places/Tree toolbar button"
msgstr "Optionele werkbalkknop Locaties/Boomstructuur tonen"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:445
msgid "Default width of the Details pane in pixels"
msgstr "Standaardbreedte van het detailpaneel in pixels"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:449
msgid "Height of Details above the resizable Quick Actions divider"
msgstr "Hoogte van Details boven de verschuifbare scheiding met Snelle acties"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:453
msgid "Visible Details metadata in display order"
msgstr "Zichtbare metadata in Details, in weergavevolgorde"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:456
msgid "Enable Quick Actions in the detail pane"
msgstr "Snelle acties in het detailpaneel inschakelen"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:460
msgid "Automatic, manual or hybrid action selection"
msgstr "Automatische, handmatige of hybride keuze van acties"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:464
msgid "Whether unavailable actions are hidden or disabled"
msgstr "Of niet-beschikbare acties verborgen of uitgeschakeld worden"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:468
msgid "Quick Action button layout"
msgstr "Knopindeling van snelle acties"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:472
msgid "Always visible Quick Actions in display order"
msgstr "Altijd zichtbare snelle acties in weergavevolgorde"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:476
msgid "Chosen actions in Manual mode and display order"
msgstr "Gekozen acties in handmatige modus en hun weergavevolgorde"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:479
msgid "Custom action ID, name, icon, type, command and contexts"
msgstr "ID, naam, pictogram, type, opdracht en contexten van aangepaste acties"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:483
msgid "Maximum automatic suggestions, zero for unlimited"
msgstr "Maximaal aantal automatische suggesties, nul voor onbeperkt"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:489
msgid "Default width of Miller columns in pixels"
msgstr "Standaardbreedte van millerkolommen in pixels"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:493
msgid "Archive format last chosen in the Compress dialog"
msgstr "Archiefformaat dat het laatst gekozen is in het venster Comprimeren"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:494
msgid ""
"One of zip, tar.gz, tar.xz, tar.zst or 7z. Formats that are not available "
"are skipped."
msgstr ""
"Een van zip, tar.gz, tar.xz, tar.zst of 7z. Formaten die niet beschikbaar "
"zijn, worden overgeslagen."

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:498
msgid "Extract To: a new folder for each archive"
msgstr "Uitpakken naar: een nieuwe map voor elk archief"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:499
msgid ""
"Last choice in the Extract To dialog. When true each archive is extracted "
"into its own new folder (not when the archive contains just one item, as "
"with Extract Here); when false the contents go straight into the chosen "
"folder and existing names are handled with the conflict dialog."
msgstr ""
"Laatste keuze in het venster Uitpakken naar. Indien waar wordt elk archief "
"uitgepakt in een eigen nieuwe map (niet als het archief maar één item bevat, "
"zoals bij Hier uitpakken); indien onwaar komt de inhoud rechtstreeks in de "
"gekozen map en worden bestaande namen afgehandeld met het conflictvenster."

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:503
msgid "Fit each Miller column to its file names"
msgstr "Elke millerkolom passend maken voor de bestandsnamen"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:504
msgid ""
"Each column becomes as wide as its longest name, up to about 30 characters "
"of the current font; longer names are ellipsized and shown in full in the "
"tooltip. Dragging a divider overrides the width of that column until it is "
"double-clicked. When off, the fixed default width and saved widths are used."
msgstr ""
"Elke kolom wordt zo breed als de langste naam, tot ongeveer 30 tekens van "
"het huidige lettertype; langere namen worden ingekort met een beletselteken "
"en volledig getoond in de tooltip. Een versleepte scheidingslijn bepaalt de "
"breedte van die kolom tot erop gedubbelklikt wordt. Indien uit, gelden de "
"vaste standaardbreedte en de opgeslagen breedtes."

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:508
msgid "Individually remembered widths of Miller columns"
msgstr "Afzonderlijk onthouden breedtes van millerkolommen"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:512
msgid "Show the Miller preview pane"
msgstr "Het voorbeeldpaneel van Miller tonen"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:516
msgid "Show bounded background folder size calculations in file inspectors"
msgstr ""

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:517
msgid ""
"Only local paths; time-limited, cancellable and never follows symbolic links."
msgstr ""

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:521
msgid "Read ahead a few items in a selected local folder"
msgstr "Enkele items vooraf inlezen in een geselecteerde lokale map"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:522
msgid "Prefetch is cancellable and never runs on remote locations."
msgstr ""
"Vooraf inlezen kan worden afgebroken en gebeurt nooit op externe locaties."

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:527
msgid "Maximum prefetched items for a selected local Miller folder"
msgstr ""
"Maximaal aantal vooraf ingelezen items voor een geselecteerde lokale Miller-"
"map"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:528
msgid "Prefetch is cancellable. Smaller values reduce work on slower disks."
msgstr ""
"Vooraf inlezen kan worden afgebroken. Kleinere waarden beperken het werk op "
"tragere schijven."

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:532
msgid "Open destination subfolders when a drag hovers over them"
msgstr "Doelsubmappen openen wanneer er iets boven wordt gesleept"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:536
msgid ""
"Scroll across Miller columns with horizontal mouse and trackpad scrolling"
msgstr ""
"Door millerkolommen scrollen met horizontaal scrollen van muis en touchpad"

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:540
