#: src/nemo-file-management-properties.c
msgid "A file manager with Miller columns, custom colours and transfer tools."
msgstr "Een bestandsbeheerder met Miller-kolommen, eigen kleuren en overdrachtshulpmiddelen."

#: src/nemo-file-management-properties.c
msgid ""
"Dakkar is a fork of Nemo, the Cinnamon file manager by Linux Mint, which is "
"itself derived from GNOME Nautilus."
msgstr ""
"Dakkar is een afsplitsing van Nemo, de bestandsbeheerder van Cinnamon door "
"Linux Mint, die zelf is afgeleid van GNOME Nautilus."

#: src/nemo-file-management-properties.c
msgid ""
"Miller columns are based on linux-nemo-miller-columns by Davide Minardi "
"(davemin), MIT License."
msgstr ""
"De Miller-kolommen zijn gebaseerd op linux-nemo-miller-columns van Davide "
"Minardi (davemin), MIT-licentie."

